      "message": "Do we already have a cleanup bug for how the alert register is being accessed?  It seems like if we received any of the above alerts between tcpci_tcpc_alert() starting and now, then we\u0027d drop it (ex. if we got TX complete while processing RX)",
      "revId": "8c094dfd9a65ade715a52cfec25761e0f7e124ee",
